# Human Pose Detection 🧍

This project detects human body keypoints (like nose, shoulders, elbows, etc.) from images, videos, or webcam using a pose estimation model.

## Features

- Detects body keypoints
- Works with image, video, or webcam
- Easy to run with Python

Libraries used - cv2, mediapipe, threading, time, math, os, csv, tkinter, PIL, ImageTk
